==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr}} {{term|bohémien||person from [[Bohemia]], [[Romani]]|lang=fr}}, from {{term|Bohême||[[Bohemia]]|lang=fr}}; compare {{term|gypsy||[[Romani]]}}, from {{term|Egypt}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# an [[unconventional]] or [[nonconformist]] [[artist]] or [[writer]].

